{"id":52926,"date":"2026-07-06T08:40:17","date_gmt":"2026-07-06T07:40:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/milha-da-cegonha\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:19:36","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:19:36","slug":"milha-da-cegonha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/milha-da-cegonha\/","title":{"rendered":"Milha da Cegonha 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Milha da Cegonha 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Milha da Cegonha 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das mais tradicionais provas do atletismo de estrada da regi\u00e3o Oeste, disputada na localidade da <strong>Cegonha<\/strong>, na freguesia de Reguengo Grande, concelho da <strong>Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>). Integrada no calend\u00e1rio oficial da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL)<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o re\u00fane atletas federados e populares numa celebra\u00e7\u00e3o da velocidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com tra\u00e7ado plano e r\u00e1pido de <strong>1.609 metros (1 Milha)<\/strong> para os escal\u00f5es de Seniores e Veteranos e dist\u00e2ncias adaptadas para os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (Benjamins, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis), a prova promovida pelo <strong>GDRC da Cegonha<\/strong> conta com cronometragem oficial, entrega de medalhas aos lugares de p\u00f3dio e trof\u00e9us coletivos por equipas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cegonha, Reguengo Grande, Lourinh\u00e3, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Milha Urbana (1.609 metros) e Provas Jovens de Pista\/Estrada<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">GDRC da Cegonha \/ Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Provas Curtas<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Milha Urbana da Cegonha (Absolutos \/ Veteranos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o AAL:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 fecho)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Provas Jovens (Benjamins a Juvenis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Jovens:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 fecho)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local da Milha da Cegonha 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das provas jovens \u00e0s 09:30 e a Milha Absoluta \u00e0s 10:30 na aldeia da Cegonha (Lourinh\u00e3).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial da prova principal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova principal tem a dist\u00e2ncia can\u00f3nica de 1 Milha Urbana (1.609 metros), disputada em circuito de asfalto fechado.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova \u00e9 gratuita?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 totalmente gratuita para atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados atrav\u00e9s da plataforma da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios admitidos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 aberta a todos os escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios, desde Benjamins A\/B (sub-10 e sub-12) at\u00e9 Seniores e Veteranos (M35 a M60+).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online no portal de competi\u00e7\u00f5es da AAL (competicoes.aalisboa.com.pt), com detalhes no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Milha da Cegonha 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cegonha, Reguengo Grande, Lourinh\u00e3\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lourinh\u00e3\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"GDRC da Cegonha \/ Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local da Milha da Cegonha 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das provas jovens \u00e0s 09:30 e a Milha Absoluta \u00e0s 10:30 na aldeia da Cegonha (Lourinh\u00e3).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial da prova principal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova principal tem a dist\u00e2ncia can\u00f3nica de 1 Milha Urbana (1.609 metros), disputada em circuito de asfalto fechado.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova \u00e9 gratuita?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 totalmente gratuita para atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados atrav\u00e9s da plataforma da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios admitidos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A competi\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 aberta a todos os escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios, desde Benjamins A\/B (sub-10 e sub-12) at\u00e9 Seniores e Veteranos (M35 a M60+).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online no portal de competi\u00e7\u00f5es da AAL (competicoes.aalisboa.com.pt), com detalhes no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":52927,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,624],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-52926","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lourinha-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-kids","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_3-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Cartaz-3o-Milha-Cegonha-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/52926","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=52926"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/52926\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{